Package: com.hmmzzz.marktheme64e
Name: MarkTheme64e
Version: 0.1.9-64e-b1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: A modular theme engine and manager for modern iOS jailbreak environments.
 MarkTheme64e supports importing SnowBoard / IconBundles style themes, and performs
 archive, manifest, and image resource validation before installation.
 .
 Can theme home screen icons, folders, badges, Spotlight, Settings, Phone, Photo Sharing,
 System Sharing, and Status Bar resources.
 Supports author masks and system native rounded corner masks.
 .
 Provides separate conventional rootless and RootHide packages, supporting iOS 16.0 and above.
 Please install the architecture that matches your jailbreak environment; the two packages cannot be mixed.
 .
 All theme parsing and compilation is completed within the manager App; the injected process only runs a minimal Runtime.
 Automatically retains the system native appearance when identity, ABI, or resource validation fails.
Maintainer: Hmmzzz
Author: Hmmzzz
Section: Utilities
Homepage: https://github.com/Hmmzzz/MarkTheme64e
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), uikittools, ellekit (>= 1.2)
